      "extract": "Fusion categories via string diagrams Bruce Bartlett Abstract We use the string diagram calculus to give graphical proofs of the basic results of Etingof, Nikshych and Ostrik [9] on fusion categories. These results include: the quadruple dual is canonically isomorphic to the identity, positivity of the paired dimensions, and Ocneanu rigidity. We introduce the pairing convention as a convenient graphical framework",
